WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
You can contact the Agency without a visit — through the unified platform e-anticor.uz.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Open the platform and select “Report corruption”.

3
00:00:31.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Describe what happened: where, when and who was involved. Attach documents or photos if you have them.

4
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Sign in with ONE ID or send the report anonymously.

5
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Check the details and send the report. You will receive a number.

6
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Use the number to check at any time what stage the review has reached.
